{"id":422,"imdb":"tt0056801","en":"8½","orig":"8½","ar":null,"tag":"A picture that goes beyond what men think about - because no man ever thought about it in quite this way!","ov":"Guido Anselmi, a film director, finds himself creatively barren at the peak of his career. Urged by his doctors to rest, Anselmi heads for a luxurious resort, but a sorry group gathers—his producer, staff, actors, wife, mistress, and relatives—each one begging him to get on with the show. In retreat from their dependency, he fantasizes about past women and dreams of his childhood.","rd":"1963-02-14","rt":139,"g":[18],"lang":"it","budget":0,"revenue":0,"companies":[{"n":"Cineriz","logo":null,"c":"IT"},{"n":"Francinex","logo":null,"c":"FR"}],"countries":["IT","FR"],"langs":["German","English","French","Italian"],"col":null,"rel":[{"c":"MX","d":"1963-01-02"},{"c":"GB","d":"1963-02-14"},{"c":"IT","d":"1963-02-14"},{"c":"DE","d":"1963-05-22"},{"c":"FR","d":"1963-05-29"},{"c":"US","d":"1963-06-24"},{"c":"SU","d":"1963-07-18"},{"c":"FI","d":"1963-09-27"},{"c":"SE","d":"1963-10-14"},{"c":"DK","d":"1963-11-05"},{"c":"NO","d":"1963-12-26"},{"c":"PT","d":"1964-02-24"},{"c":"ES","d":"1967-05-15"},{"c":"AU","d":"1995-04-13"},{"c":"BR","d":"2014-01-14"},{"c":"NL","d":"2018-09-20"},{"c":"RU","d":"2020-11-12"},{"c":"GR","d":"2025-06-05"},{"c":"KR","d":"2025-07-23"},{"c":"EE","d":"2025-11-10"}],"dir":["Federico Fellini"],"prod":["Angelo Rizzoli"],"wri":["Ennio Flaiano","Tullio Pinelli","Brunello Rondi","Federico Fellini"],"mus":["Nino Rota"],"dop":["Gianni Di Venanzo"],"cast":[{"n":"Marcello Mastroianni","ch":"Guido Anselmi","p":"/bfLnFfNfMC73Q7WW90xQy2PvRZm.jpg"},{"n":"Claudia Cardinale","ch":"Claudia","p":"/m7iyqSEMHI1qmKx7ml4HmVyG0BC.jpg"},{"n":"Anouk Aimée","ch":"Luisa Anselmi","p":"/rXkZZRfbBlGfcxQstQqeXX0GDZx.jpg"},{"n":"Sandra Milo","ch":"Carla","p":"/hEUQ8Cj8kTSCAcSMFxutME4MRqv.jpg"},{"n":"Rossella Falk","ch":"Rossella","p":"/30pEtkiH2drjkke3nfjjGYhouhN.jpg"},{"n":"Barbara Steele","ch":"Gloria Mor